ka Nakamura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zYAR0JexnpguIAN2t2gilPfwnxB.jpg"},{"id":1975391,"name":"Ikuko Takaishi"},{"id":25466,"name":"Eiji Okada","role":"Shogen Wakita","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mQb4kOYl1WlISWZOStAhm13DHdQ.jpg"},{"id":230787,"name":"Minoru Ōki","role":"Yagyu Retsudo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aVKV4mPRBf0ofLGRAP5jguEBnrG.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart in the Land of Demons","overview":"Il signore del potente clan Kuroda mette in pericolo l'onore e il prestigio del suo clan per interessi personali, i suoi sottoposti ingaggiano il lupo solitario per smascherare l'intrigo. Memorabili i cavalieri mascherati Kuroda e l'incontro con il bonzo Wajo Jikei."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart in the Land of Demons","overview":"Ogami Itto is challenged by a quintet of warriors, each armed with one fifth of Ogami's assassin fee and one fifth of the information he needs to complete his assignment."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"小池一夫、小島剛夕の人気劇画を1972年に若山富三郎の主演で映画が4本続けて作られた翌年、萬屋錦之助主演のTVシリーズも始まる中、それと競合する形で登場した娯楽時代劇シリーズの第5作。第4作での休みを挟んで三隅研次が監督に復帰。\r 幼子の大五郎を乳母車に乗せてさすらいの旅を続ける、元公儀介錯人の拝一刀。彼ら父子に筑前黒田藩の密使たる剣の使い手たちが次々と襲い掛かるが、実はそれらは、一刀の実力のほどを測る腕試しだった。同藩の存続に関わる重大な機密情報を知った公儀探索方の隠密が、密書を持って江戸へ向かうのを、どうか阻止して密書を奪ってほしいと、くノ一忍者たる不知火から同藩の苦しい事情を聞かされた一刀は、その仕事を引き受ける。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ek4DtdiywAYT9EYdVrv5aXOfteS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yqiBjLP6ZQgBpXYrmAmSbT7Lvf0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":41482,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9GVtFK1lVfQLHL1uPl2Sqy3Hz